# Fblthp, Lost on the Range: "The plot cost is equal to its mana cost" (CR 702.170a), and a cost based on the mana cost of an
# object with no mana cost can't be paid (CR 118.6). Lotus Bloom, on top of Bot1's library, has no mana cost, so it can't be
# plotted from there: the special action is not offered, though plotting asks no mana that Bot1 lacks, and Lotus Bloom stays
# on top of the library.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Fblthp, Lost on the Range
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Lotus Bloom
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Fblthp, Lost on the Range.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.MayLookAtLibraryTop = true
! Bot1.Library.Lotus Bloom.Activate(Ability: Plot)

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Library.Count = 11
